        "metadata": {
          "category": "stories",
          "media": {
            "duration": 754,
            "fileSize": 12215263
          },
          "author": "Matthew Cordell",
          "description": "Poppy loves scary movies. Cornbread does not. Poppy adores runny cheese. Cornbread does not. Poppy can’t wait to try a roller coaster. Cornbread… can. But Cornbread and Poppy are the best of friends, so when the carnival rolls into town, Cornbread agrees to check it out. Their day promises fun games, yummy snacks, and big, big rides. What new things will these mice try?  Filled with playful narration and engaging storytelling, this audiobook brings all the sights, sounds, and excitement of the carnival straight to your ears. A fun and heartwarming listen for kids who love dynamic characters and stories they can enjoy anytime.",
